@startuml UC7_VisualizationPath_Final
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC7] Visualization of a Path

' =======================================================
' COMPONENT DEFINITION
' =======================================================
actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile Application" as Client

' Servizio Esterno (Indispensabile per il rendering grafico)
participant "MapServiceProvider" as Map

' Backend System
participant "PathResearch" as PR
participant "BikePath DBMS" as DB

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, Client: Entry Condition: User has selected a path and presses "View"

' =======================================================
' (a) FETCH DATA & MAP CONTEXT
' =======================================================
User -> Client: pressView(pathID)
activate Client

' 1. Recupero Dati del Percorso (Logica di Business)
note right of Client: Step 1: Get coordinates & scores from Backend
Client -> PR: getAggregatedPathDetails(pathID)
activate PR

' Query al DBMS
note right of PR: Fetch Path Entity JOIN Streets (with Scores)
PR -> DB: fetchAggregatedPathData(pathID)
activate DB
DB --> PR: AggregatedPathEntity
deactivate DB

' Ritorno dati al Client
PR --> Client: returnPathDetails(PathDTO)
deactivate PR

' 2. Recupero Dati Cartografici (Logica di Visualizzazione)
note right of Client: Step 2: Request map background for specific coords
Client -> Map: requestMapContext(PathDTO.coordinates)
activate Map
Map --> Client: returnMapTiles(VectorData)
deactivate Map

' =======================================================
' RENDERING LATO CLIENT
' =======================================================
note right of Client: **Rendering Logic:**\nOverlay Business Data (Colored Lines) on Map Tiles


Client -> Client: renderMapWithOverlays()
Client --> User: displayPathDetails(Map, Legend)

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
User -> Client: pressExit()

Client -> Client: closeDetailView()
Client --> User: returnToRankedList()

note over User, Client: Exit Condition: User returns to the search results

deactivate Client
@enduml